.TH Num.tex 3 2026-08-27 "Tomo man-pages"
.SH NAME
Num.tex \- exact form as TeX
.SH LIBRARY
Tomo Standard Library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.BI Num.tex\ :\ func(n:\ Num\ ->\ Text)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The exact value as TeX math-mode source.


.SH ARGUMENTS

.TS
allbox;
lb lb lbx
l l l.
Name	Type	Description
n	Num	The number to render. 
.TE
.SH RETURN
The TeX source.

.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
assert (1./3.).tex() == "\[rs]\[rs]frac{1}{3}"
assert (2.).sqrt()!.tex() == "\[rs]\[rs]sqrt{2}"
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Tomo-Num (3)
